      skos:note "Commercial productization (boxed hardware, hosted demos, SaaS) is held back as a contingent path — pursued only if external demand materializes through unsolicited inbound from modular synth, jazz, or visual-art communities." .

    # ── Claims: Trigger conditions section ──────────────────────
    narr:Claim_TriggerUnsolicitedInbound a narr:Claim ;
